<rml><head><title>Localization stress fixture</title><link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/base.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/components.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="/styles/accessibility.rcss"/></head><body class="c-fixture-page"><main class="c-panel"><h1>⟦ An exceptionally long localized workshop title with UTF-8 Ångström Жук 日本語 مرحبا ⟧</h1><label for="utf8_name">Player-authored UTF-8 name</label><input id="utf8_name" class="text" type="text" value="Mýr Жук 山 مرحبا"/><button>⟦ Confirm this deliberately verbose localized action without truncating its stored value ⟧</button><p>Status: Ready — not represented by color alone.</p></main></body></rml>
